nd it is bound; that is your only spell. Bosses lose a piece with every loop. The demo is the whole descent: five acts, 35 floors and five bosses, down to Slagheart, with a secret area to find on the way. It stays up after the fest. Played it already? An honest review on the demo page helps us more than anything: https://store.steampowered.com/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037500-1845383656393446","game_id":"steam-5037500","kind":"announcement","title":"New Pages: \"The Estate\"","summary":"Greetings & FeedbackHello, Scribes! We've been hard at work getting ready for October's Next Fest. As things stand right now, all of our progression and content has been implemented; it just needs to be tested and balanced. We have been hearing some feedback regarding game difficulty. To help with this, we added a new setting (enabled by default) that allows players to see their hitbox. This will be shown as a ring, or signet, on the player's hand.Additionally, we gave Vellum a new option when y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T13:17:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393446","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037500-1842212951300169","game_id":"steam-5037500","kind":"announcement","title":"The Spell Unbound Demo is Live","summary":"Greetings Hello Scribes! This is the first of hopefully many devlogs, and while I'm new to this hopefully we can all get a good flow going. First things first Spell Unbound!! Our demo is finally out!We initially intended to go live with it last week, 